        "TileImage": "$($repository 4d4ee135-ef81-4b66-8149-ad774fb34970).Image",
        "Description": "Hear this 47. The owner of a city bank needs our help. We have two targets, the first one is Jimme Gladwin wich is a worker at the bank but our client overheard someone saying that he was gonna leak information about the bank so he unfortunatly needs to pass away. The other target Ruby Red is a journalist who is trying to dig up dirt about the owner who also happends to be our client. You can probably find Jimmie going to the bathroom often since he got pretty drunk last night.\r\rGood luck 47",
